Error [E0379]: a guard follows its source with no comma
  --> tests/ui/loop_guard_comma_misspelling.jet:2:34
    |
  2 |     values :: loop u in [1, 2, 3], if u > 1 -> u
    |                                  ^
 Why: the guard self-announces with `if`, so the loop head only uses commas between positional clauses
 Fix: remove the comma before `if`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0379
